          <strong>Permitted & Prohibited Conduct:</strong> You are granted a limited, revocable, non-exclusive license to use the tools for personal wellness calculation. You agree not to perform automated screen scraping, unauthorized crawling, denial-of-service attempts, or reverse engineering of the mathematical source code.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Intellectual Property Rights:</strong> All proprietary design systems, graphics, typography pairings, code structures, and visual implementations are the intellectual property of Real BMI and protected by international copyright laws.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Disclaimer of Warranties:</strong> The service is provided strictly on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis. While we verify formulas against peer-reviewed literature (WHO, CDC, Mifflin-St Jeor), we make no express warranties regarding diagnostic fitness or clinical completeness.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Limitation of Liability:</strong> Under no circumstances shall Real BMI or its maintainers be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from reliance on calculator outputs.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Select Your Language Version</h2>
      <p>Read the full Terms and Conditions in your preferred language:</p>
      <div class="lang-grid">
        <a href="/en/terms-conditions/" class="lang-link">🇺🇸 English (EN)</a>
        <a href="/es/terms-conditions/" class="lang-link">🇪🇸 Español (ES)</a>
        <a href="/fr/terms-conditions/" class="lang-link">🇫🇷 Français (FR)</a>
        <a href="/de/terms-conditions/" class="lang-link">🇩🇪 Deutsch (DE)</a>
        <a href="/ko/terms-conditions/" class="lang-link">🇰🇷 한국어 (KO)</a>
        <a href="/hi/terms-conditions/" class="lang-link">🇮🇳 हिन्दी (HI)</a>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
        <a href="/en/terms-conditions/" class="btn">Read Complete English Terms & Conditions →</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
